Tag: purpose::console, role::developer
Description: Node.js 24 LTS interpreter
 Cross-built for rootless jailbreaks as aarch64-apple-ios. Installs versioned
 names node-24, npm-24 and npx-24. The node-24 wrapper runs V8 with --jitless
 unless NODE_IOS_ALLOW_JIT=1. Install node-default to put node, npm and npx
 on PATH.
